    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>Your powers were created in a lab and had some unexpected side effects.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers</div><p>Assign all the dice you rolled at the end of the background step to any of the following powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Elemental/Energy powers category</p><p>• Select from Intellectual powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Self Control powers category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, each using a different power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.pHoZH9FjeegXJBHE]{Personal Upgrade}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.I3ey6SxXKb8PQn9Z]{Misdirection}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.WdH4qGjjzWilHxVK]{Throw Minion}</li></ul><p>Gain one of these Green abilities:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.PNXHZkbzkUSgB9MB]{Overpower}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.2aDrJ4JVAxEsT8xD]{Unflagging}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Archetype</div><p>Roll d8, d8, d8 for archetype selection.</p></section>"
